    {
      "text": "Ledyba secretes an aromatic fluid from where its legs join its body. This fluid is used for communicating with others. This Pokémon conveys its feelings to others by altering the fluid’s scent.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "They are timid and grow uneasy when not in a swarm with others of their kind. The pattern on their backs differs slightly from one to another.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "They communicate with one another using bodily fluids that give off odors. When they’re angry, their odor smells sour.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon is very sensitive to cold. In the warmth of Alola, it appears quite lively.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "These very cowardly Pokémon join together and use Reflect to protect their nest.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    }
